{
  "title": "Continuous alkaline phosphatase retains incremental cross-cycle prediction of log CRP beyond a standard enzyme panel",
  "abstract": "In complete-case NHANES adults 20\u201379, adding continuous log alkaline phosphatase to a fixed standard enzyme/inflammation/metabolic model trained in 2005\u201306 reduces MEC-weighted log-CRP MSE in separately sampled 2007\u201308 adults by 0.025593 (conditional-source target-PSU 95% interval 0.016492\u20130.034520); this is cross-cycle surrogate prediction, not new biomarker discovery or external clinical validation.",
